ADR+ (adr-plus)
Copyright 2026 Writerblockade

ADR+ was worked out in practice over 232 architecture decision records in one large solo-owned project, and is
packaged in the makeadr skill of pitmaster (https://github.com/MapleSyrupOS/pitmaster).

ADR+ takes several elements from MADR, Markdown Architectural Decision Records (https://adr.github.io/madr/):
decision drivers, per-option pros and cons, Good/Bad consequences, confirmation, a rejected status and a YAML
header. The wording is ADR+'s own. SPEC.md section 1.7 lists each borrowed element and its source.
